SUMMARY:Saturday Night Mass
DESCRIPTION:Instruments of Peace: Standing in the Space Between\nFor the Feast of Saint Francis\, we will gather to reflect on scripture\, prayers\, and music that focus on being instruments of peace. The Mass will feature local singer-songwriter Liz Fulmer\, who will perform original faith-based songs and cover tunes\, including Sarah McLachlan’s “Prayer of Saint Francis\,” accompanied by her acoustic guitar. \nThis Mass will lead into a 5-week Contemplative Citizenship series aimed at giving people contemplative tools as they enter the midterm election season. \nMost Saturday Night Masses are streamed and can be viewed from our website by clicking here. \n 
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/saturday-night-mass-5-2-2/
LOCATION:Saint James Episcopal Church\, 103 North Duke Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Saturday Night Mass
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Home-Page-Image-4-copy.jpg
